BS_:

BU_: ECU IVI

BO_ 512 EngineStatus: 8 ECU
 SG_ EngineRPM : 0|16@1+ (1,0) [0|65535] "rpm" IVI
 SG_ CoolantTemp : 16|16@1- (0.1,0) [-3276.8|3276.7] "degC" IVI

BO_ 513 FuelStatus: 8 ECU
 SG_ FuelLevelPct : 0|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "%" IVI

CM_ "Powertrain (ICE) ECU: the engine controller. Only present on a vehicle that
burns fuel (ICE, mild/full/plug-in hybrid); a battery-electric vehicle has no
such ECU, which is why these signals are their own profile rather than part of
the common Vehicle ECU. CAN ID range 0x200-0x27F.";
CM_ BO_ 512 "Engine RPM and coolant temperature";
CM_ BO_ 513 "Fuel tank status";
CM_ SG_ 512 EngineRPM "Engine speed";
CM_ SG_ 512 CoolantTemp "Engine coolant temperature, 0.1 degC per bit, signed";
CM_ SG_ 513 FuelLevelPct "Tank fuel level; operating range 0..100 %";
